-Rating(N/mm)
-Top cover thickness(mm)
-Bottom cover thickness(mm)
-Length(m)</td></tr><tr><td width="5">5</td><td>Verify Unit of measure field is mandatory field </td><td>Unit of measure is not mandatory field </td></tr><tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Execution type:</span></td><td colspan="3">Manual</td></tr>
