<a name="toc_tc90478"></a><p>&nbsp;</p><div> <table class="tc" width="90%" ><tr><th colspan="4">Test Case CTCP-4840: Verify carcass field functionality as per selection of Top and bottom cover compound&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 80%;">[Version  : 1]</span></th></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Author:</span></td><td colspan="3">uie_32437</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Summary:</span><br /><p>Verify carcass field functionality as per selection of Top and bottom cover compound&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Preconditions:</span><br /><p>User is on Add conveyor details page&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td><span class="label">#:</span></td><td><span class="label">Step actions:</span></td><td><span class="label">Expected Results:</span></td></tr><tr><td width="5">1</td><td><p>Verify add conveyor details page&nbsp;</p>
</td><td><p>User should able to navigate&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">2</td><td><p>Now add all mandatory fields for conveyor&nbsp;</p>
</td><td><p>User should&nbsp;able to add&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">3</td><td><p>Navigate to conveyor lite tab and select carcass type field&nbsp;</p>
</td><td><p>User should&nbsp;able&nbsp;to navigate and select the carcass Type as ST or TX&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">4</td><td><p>Validate carcass type is displayed in bottom graph&nbsp;</p>
</td><td><p>Based on user selection ST or TX should be displayed in bottom graph</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">5</td><td><p>Validate Top Reinforcement Breaker field&nbsp;</p>
</td><td><p>On click None, Steel and Textile should be dispalyed in dropdown</p>

<p>Based on selection of steel and Textile value &#39;S&#39; and &#39;T &#39;should also be dispalyed in graph also</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">6</td><td><p>Validate Bottom Reinforcement Breaker field&nbsp;</p>
</td><td><p>On click None, Steel and Textile should be displayed in dropdown. Based on selection of Steel and Textile value &#39;S&#39; and &#39;T&#39; should also be displayed in graph&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">7</td><td><p>Fill other fields data also&nbsp;</p>
</td><td><p>User should able to fill all fields data</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">8</td><td><p>Validate the listing of the conveyor in conveyor list&nbsp;</p>
</td><td><p>Conveyor should be displayed on top of the list&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">9</td><td><p>Validate the data displayed in installed belt column&nbsp;</p>
</td><td><p>Following data should be dispalyed : (Belt Construction)&nbsp;(Width) (CarcassType)&nbsp;(Breaking Strength)/(Number of plies)&nbsp;(Top cover thickness)(Top Reinforcement Breaker)/&nbsp;(Bottom&nbsp;cover thickness)(Bottom&nbsp;Reinforcement Breaker)&nbsp;Top cover compound/Bottom cover compound</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Execution type:</span></td><td colspan="3">Manual</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Estimated exec. duration (min):</span></td><td colspan="3"></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Importance:</span></td><td colspan="3">High</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"></td></tr><tr><td > Automation Status:</td><td  colspan = "3" >To Be Analysed</td></tr>
<tr><td > Notes:</td><td  colspan = "3" ></td></tr>
<tr><td > Review Comments:</td><td  colspan = "3" ></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Requirements</span><td colspan="3">&nbsp;None<br /></td></tr>
